    "project.about-site.summary": "The site you're reading. A self-hosted personal site with a hand-built Saturn design system.",
    "project.about-site.body": "Astro and Tailwind, statically built and served by nginx behind Traefik on my own hardware. The Saturn glyph is a custom SVG: real ring colors, atmospheric banding, and an RT-541 wordmark sitting in front of the planet but behind the rings. No analytics, no trackers, no third-party hosting. It runs on the same box as everything else I self-host.",
