    "project.zomboid-tooling.body": "A growing set of scripts that handle the things a long-running game server eventually needs. World resets that preserve player progression. A migration path for the Build 42 jump. RCON-driven recovery that restores a player's items and XP from a backup without handing back a god character. It started as a one-off reset script and turned into a small operational toolkit, runbook included.",
    "project.churncore.title": "ChurnCore — Project Zomboid mod suite",
    "project.churncore.summary": "Three-mod suite for a private Project Zomboid B42 multiplayer server: an event engine, meta progression, and an Army relief narrative.",
    "project.churncore.body": "A framework mod (engine, stages, registries, UI, client/server state sync), an events mod driving missions, radio broadcasts, and music, and a bridge to the Bandits NPC mod. The world escalates through stages under an event director: supply drops, horde spawns, weather events, all steerable from an in-game admin panel and dashboard. Built in Lua against Build 42 multiplayer, with unit tests and a scripted deploy loop. In active development.",
